{"3638270":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Derail Party","steam_appid":3638270,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One rule: only the front of a locomotive crashes<\/h2>Your locomotive follows your mouse and never stops. Grab gold nuggets: every 3 nuggets add a wagon. The longer your train, the more room it takes on the map… and the more tempting it is to cut someone off.<br><br>Crash into a train and you derail: your wagons scatter as nuggets for everyone else. Get hit on the side or from behind and nothing happens to you: it's the other driver who goes off the rails.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Steer<\/strong> with the mouse. Plan your turns: there are no brakes.<br><\/li><li><strong>Collect<\/strong> nuggets to grow your train.<br><\/li><li><strong>Boost<\/strong> with a click or Space. Your stamina refills on its own; once it's empty, boosting costs wagons.<br><\/li><li><strong>Derail<\/strong> the others by cutting across their path.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online, up to 30 players<\/h2>Up to 30 trains on the same map. When few players are online, AI trains (marked “AI”) liven up the match and give their place to real players as they arrive. Invite your Steam friends, or join their match from the Steam friends list. Solo: a private match against bots to train in, with its own leaderboard.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Always something to aim for<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Levels and three new daily quests every day<br><\/li><li>Leaderboards: daily, weekly and all-time, online and solo, or just among friends<br><\/li><li>Merit titles earned with your best online matches<br><\/li><li>The Workshop: upgrades, bonus cards and chests earned by playing (never sold)<br><\/li><li>Achievements with five tiers each<br><\/li><li>4 bonuses on the map: Magnet, Turbo, Shield, Nuggets ×2<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Friends and customization<\/h2>Add friends with their ID, chat with them and join their match in one click. Pick one of 8 free train colors, or unlock trails and derail effects with gold earned in game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One account, everywhere<\/h2>You're signed in with Steam automatically, and your progress is saved to your account. Link an e-mail, Google, Apple or Discord in the settings to play with the same progress on your other devices.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free to play<\/h2>The whole game is free. Diamonds, sold in the shop, buy cosmetics, gold and the pass (a daily gift and more gold per match). Chests are never sold: they are earned by playing.","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One rule: only the front of a locomotive crashes<\/h2>Your locomotive follows your mouse and never stops. Grab gold nuggets: every 3 nuggets add a wagon. The longer your train, the more room it takes on the map… and the more tempting it is to cut someone off.<br><br>Crash into a train and you derail: your wagons scatter as nuggets for everyone else. Get hit on the side or from behind and nothing happens to you: it's the other driver who goes off the rails.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Steer<\/strong> with the mouse. Plan your turns: there are no brakes.<br><\/li><li><strong>Collect<\/strong> nuggets to grow your train.<br><\/li><li><strong>Boost<\/strong> with a click or Space. Your stamina refills on its own; once it's empty, boosting costs wagons.<br><\/li><li><strong>Derail<\/strong> the others by cutting across their path.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online, up to 30 players<\/h2>Up to 30 trains on the same map. When few players are online, AI trains (marked “AI”) liven up the match and give their place to real players as they arrive. Invite your Steam friends, or join their match from the Steam friends list. Solo: a private match against bots to train in, with its own leaderboard.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Always something to aim for<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Levels and three new daily quests every day<br><\/li><li>Leaderboards: daily, weekly and all-time, online and solo, or just among friends<br><\/li><li>Merit titles earned with your best online matches<br><\/li><li>The Workshop: upgrades, bonus cards and chests earned by playing (never sold)<br><\/li><li>Achievements with five tiers each<br><\/li><li>4 bonuses on the map: Magnet, Turbo, Shield, Nuggets ×2<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Friends and customization<\/h2>Add friends with their ID, chat with them and join their match in one click. Pick one of 8 free train colors, or unlock trails and derail effects with gold earned in game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One account, everywhere<\/h2>You're signed in with Steam automatically, and your progress is saved to your account. Link an e-mail, Google, Apple or Discord in the settings to play with the same progress on your other devices.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free to play<\/h2>The whole game is free. Diamonds, sold in the shop, buy cosmetics, gold and the pass (a daily gift and more gold per match). Chests are never sold: they are earned by playing.","short_description":"Drive a locomotive that never stops, grab gold nuggets to add wagons and cut off your rivals so they crash into your train. Up to 30 real players per match, solo mode against bots, daily quests and leaderboards. Free to play, same account as the browser version.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Indonesian, Japanese, Dutch, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Romanian, Russian, Swedish, Czech, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Hindi","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/624e0f3eadeb4832358f53b8f2ef4d6415d96c22\/header.jpg?t=1793699618","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/0cc7cfce3fe2d3bbe31de6d8483cb6481c6b3dd1\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793699618","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/0cc7cfce3fe2d3bbe31de6d8483cb6481c6b3dd1\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793699618","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual core 2 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> WebGL 2 compatible (Intel HD 520, Radeon R5 or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Internet connection required: every match (solo included) runs on the server. Mouse recommended.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad core 3 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated graphics card or Intel Iris Xe<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection, ping under 100 ms<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 22.04 64 bits, SteamOS 3 ou équivalent (glibc 2.35)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Double cœur 2 GHz (x86-64)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.3 \/ WebGL 2 (Mesa 22, Intel HD 520, Radeon R5 ou mieux)<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Internet connection required: every match (solo included) runs on the server. Mouse recommended.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 24.04 64 bits ou SteamOS 3 (Steam Deck)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quadruple cœur 3 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Carte dédiée ou APU récent (Steam Deck), pilotes Mesa ou NVIDIA à jour<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection, ping under 100 ms<\/li><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"© 2026 Derail Party. All rights reserved.","developers":["AlexBZicker"],"publishers":["AlexBZicker","Everworld"],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":49,"description":"PvP"},{"id":36,"description":"Online PvP"},{"id":27,"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":35,"description":"In-App Purchases"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":18,"description":"Partial Controller Support"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"37","description":"Free To Play"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/44914c9733559f8d4e2568bdfeb4826eccc4f967\/ss_44914c9733559f8d4e2568bdfeb4826eccc4f967.600x338.jpg?t=1793699618","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/44914c9733559f8d4e2568bdfeb4826eccc4f967\/ss_44914c9733559f8d4e2568bdfeb4826eccc4f967.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793699618"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/8efd1993c5e67185f55a4c5b559d26e16f42e426\/ss_8efd1993c5e67185f55a4c5b559d26e16f42e426.600x338.jpg?t=1793699618","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/8efd1993c5e67185f55a4c5b559d26e16f42e426\/ss_8efd1993c5e67185f55a4c5b559d26e16f42e426.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793699618"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/284bcdeeaef629f5ed065fd6447b0da5c31766b5\/ss_284bcdeeaef629f5ed065fd6447b0da5c31766b5.600x338.jpg?t=1793699618","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/284bcdeeaef629f5ed065fd6447b0da5c31766b5\/ss_284bcdeeaef629f5ed065fd6447b0da5c31766b5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793699618"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/15496e56b08475c5dadf21da54afe71e6e753b82\/ss_15496e56b08475c5dadf21da54afe71e6e753b82.600x338.jpg?t=1793699618","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/15496e56b08475c5dadf21da54afe71e6e753b82\/ss_15496e56b08475c5dadf21da54afe71e6e753b82.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793699618"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/db509406475265b98e260e6063cabaf04df0b142\/ss_db509406475265b98e260e6063cabaf04df0b142.600x338.jpg?t=1793699618","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/db509406475265b98e260e6063cabaf04df0b142\/ss_db509406475265b98e260e6063cabaf04df0b142.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793699618"},{"id":5,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/25e5875b2af9761c4b7773cff60cf15bfc8b2063\/ss_25e5875b2af9761c4b7773cff60cf15bfc8b2063.600x338.jpg?t=1793699618","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/25e5875b2af9761c4b7773cff60cf15bfc8b2063\/ss_25e5875b2af9761c4b7773cff60cf15bfc8b2063.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793699618"},{"id":6,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/c11381487b05943917586392c41bff9d3a807dcf\/ss_c11381487b05943917586392c41bff9d3a807dcf.600x338.jpg?t=1793699618","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/c11381487b05943917586392c41bff9d3a807dcf\/ss_c11381487b05943917586392c41bff9d3a807dcf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793699618"},{"id":7,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/6e11b6879aedee065a2a8259bb6d92ff75344f4f\/ss_6e11b6879aedee065a2a8259bb6d92ff75344f4f.600x338.jpg?t=1793699618","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/6e11b6879aedee065a2a8259bb6d92ff75344f4f\/ss_6e11b6879aedee065a2a8259bb6d92ff75344f4f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793699618"}],"movies":[{"id":257440071,"name":"Trailer - Présentation","thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/257440071\/17d6c27749297e7bd978ac49c840c83b3335e58d\/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1792582157","dash_av1":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/3638270\/660868478\/8737dbca9a80bc4477b402c7ac9fcfacfa5cd3b7\/1792581666\/dash_av1.mpd?t=1792582157","dash_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/3638270\/660868478\/8737dbca9a80bc4477b402c7ac9fcfacfa5cd3b7\/1792581666\/dash_h264.mpd?t=1792582157","hls_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/3638270\/660868478\/8737dbca9a80bc4477b402c7ac9fcfacfa5cd3b7\/1792581666\/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1792582157","highlight":true}],"achievements":{"total":79,"highlighted":[{"icon":"810f6fc90cff8e139c40346ec82926c886c6b119.jpg","localized_name":"Gold digger I","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Gold digger I","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/3638270\/810f6fc90cff8e139c40346ec82926c886c6b119.jpg"},{"icon":"c0cff70d7038fa84a0b9e551a71eb4fce92e837a.jpg","localized_name":"Gold digger II","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Gold digger II","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/3638270\/c0cff70d7038fa84a0b9e551a71eb4fce92e837a.jpg"},{"icon":"80d382e2f039719281fbefec387cf1baeb0935ee.jpg","localized_name":"Gold digger III","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Gold digger III","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/3638270\/80d382e2f039719281fbefec387cf1baeb0935ee.jpg"},{"icon":"af1dd9bf8971517d52b0eb81506e35eaced2a3ba.jpg","localized_name":"Gold digger IV","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Gold digger IV","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/3638270\/af1dd9bf8971517d52b0eb81506e35eaced2a3ba.jpg"},{"icon":"90b56ded52a2f7388313facb686e67241001f6ea.jpg","localized_name":"Gold digger V","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Gold digger V","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/3638270\/90b56ded52a2f7388313facb686e67241001f6ea.jpg"},{"icon":"e4de96174396d09476263f438ab28d2cacf8edc2.jpg","localized_name":"Derailer I","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Derailer I","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/3638270\/e4de96174396d09476263f438ab28d2cacf8edc2.jpg"},{"icon":"0363b4f5aa4ed395e8f8719a2b3aea9f4b7a8e29.jpg","localized_name":"Derailer II","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Derailer II","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/3638270\/0363b4f5aa4ed395e8f8719a2b3aea9f4b7a8e29.jpg"},{"icon":"c82fa0ec68ce9a7a87b6a513676e98b6138ae3ea.jpg","localized_name":"Derailer III","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Derailer III","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/3638270\/c82fa0ec68ce9a7a87b6a513676e98b6138ae3ea.jpg"},{"icon":"a69868ec1e7d3093ef4f33afe2aa985418acab42.jpg","localized_name":"Derailer IV","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Derailer IV","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/3638270\/a69868ec1e7d3093ef4f33afe2aa985418acab42.jpg"},{"icon":"adb16f15084e33495cf35e2c794abcace0f78c25.jpg","localized_name":"Derailer V","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Derailer V","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/3638270\/adb16f15084e33495cf35e2c794abcace0f78c25.jpg"}]},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"Nov 3, 2026"},"support_info":{"url":"https:\/\/derailparty.com\/support","email":"support@derailparty.com"},"background":"https:\/\/store.akamai.steamstatic.com\/images\/storepagebackground\/app\/3638270?t=1793699618","background_raw":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3638270\/9c0eb7af06a97241d4163374739e86ae982ced97\/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1793699618","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"ratings":{"dejus":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"14","required_age":"14","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":""},"steam_germany":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"12","required_age":"12","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":""}}}}}